---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/content';
---
<Layout title="Privacy information"><PageIntro eyebrow="Your information" title="A clear, simple approach to privacy." description="How this redesigned website handles information, and what happens when you choose to contact the foundation or use an external service." /><section class="section container prose"><h2>This website.</h2><p>This version serves static pages. It does not include advertising trackers, analytics scripts, embedded social-media feeds, or a visitor account system. The site’s code does not set tracking cookies or store form drafts in browser storage.</p><p>A hosting provider may process request information such as IP addresses and access logs when delivering pages. The production hosting provider and its retention details must be identified before public launch.</p><h2>Email-draft helpers.</h2><p>Contact and inquiry fields are processed in your browser to prepare a message. This website does not send those fields to a server. You choose whether to open your email app and send the draft, or copy it yourself. Once sent, your message is handled by your email provider and the foundation’s email service.</p><p>Do not include card numbers, passwords, identity documents, or other sensitive information in a message. An inquiry is not a newsletter subscription.</p><h2>Donations and newsletter subscriptions.</h2><p>When verified provider links are configured, payments and subscriptions take place on those external services. Their privacy policies, processing practices, and terms apply. This site does not collect card details or confirm payment success. If a provider has not been connected, it offers an email inquiry instead.</p><h2>External resources.</h2><p>Links to social platforms, archive pages, partner websites, and public records take you to services operated independently. Local images and fonts are served with the site rather than loaded from those platforms when you visit a page.</p><h2>Questions or requests.</h2><p>Contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> about information you have sent to the foundation. If you subscribed through a newsletter provider, use its unsubscribe mechanism or contact the foundation.</p><p class="source-note">Implementation disclosure prepared September 18, 2026. The foundation should review this information against its actual hosting, email, donation, and retention arrangements before launch.</p></section></Layout>
